<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>图片工具箱 - ZenTools</title>

<style>
:root{
    --bg:#0f172a;
    --card:#1e293b;
    --card-hover:#334155;
    --text:#f8fafc;
    --muted:#94a3b8;
    --primary:#3b82f6;
}

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    min-height:100vh;
}

.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:30px 20px;
}

.header{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

.header h1{
    font-size:2.5rem;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #60a5fa);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
}

.header p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:1.1rem;
}

.back{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-bottom:30px;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    background:var(--primary);
    padding:10px 18px;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}

.back:hover{
    background:#2563eb;
    transform: translateX(-4px);
}

.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:25px;
    transition:.3s;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:white;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
    background:var(--card-hover);
}

.icon{
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:1.6;
}

.footer{
    margin-top:50px;
    text-align:center;
    color:var(--muted);
}

@media(max-width:768px){
    .header h1{
        font-size:2rem;
    }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

<a href="/" class="back">← 返回首页</a>

<div class="header">
    <h1>🖼️ 图片工具箱</h1>
    <p>在线图片处理工具集合，无需安装软件，全部本地处理</p>
</div>

<div class="grid">
    <!-- 图片压缩（核心工具，重点突出） -->
    <a href="compress.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">📦</div>
        <h3>图片压缩</h3>
        <p>压缩 JPG、PNG、WebP 图片体积，减少文件大小。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="resize.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">📐</div>
        <h3>图片尺寸调整</h3>
        <p>快速修改图片宽度和高度。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="crop.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">✂️</div>
        <h3>图片裁剪</h3>
        <p>自由裁剪图片区域。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="convert.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🔄</div>
        <h3>图片格式转换</h3>
        <p>JPG、PNG、WEBP 等格式互转。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="watermark.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">💧</div>
        <h3>图片加水印</h3>
        <p>添加文字或图片水印。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="remove-bg.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🎭</div>
        <h3>背景移除</h3>
        <p>智能抠图与背景透明化。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="imgtopdf.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">📄</div>
        <h3>图片转PDF</h3>
        <p>将图片转换为 PDF 文件。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="imagebase64.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🔢</div>
        <h3>图片转Base64</h3>
        <p>将图片转换为 Base64 编码。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="colorpicker.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>颜色选择器</h3>
        <p>屏幕取色，获取颜色代码。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="collage.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🖼️</div>
        <h3>图片拼贴</h3>
        <p>多张图片拼贴成一张。</p>
    </a>

    <a href="video-thumbnail.html" class="card">
        <div class="icon">🎬</div>
        <h3>视频缩略图</h3>
        <p>从视频中提取缩略图。</p>
    </a>
</div>

<div class="footer">
    © 2026 ZenTools 图片工具箱 | 所有处理均在本地完成，不上传服务器
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>